description:
Write in `solution.c`, using the bitwise operators (bit 0 is the lowest bit, n is from 0 to 31):

```c
bool bit_is_set(uint32_t x, int n);
uint32_t set_bit(uint32_t x, int n);
uint32_t clear_bit(uint32_t x, int n);
uint32_t toggle_bit(uint32_t x, int n);
int count_bits(uint32_t x);              /* how many bits are 1 */
bool is_power_of_two(uint32_t x);        /* 1, 2, 4, 8, ...; 0 is not */
uint32_t rotate_left(uint32_t x, int n); /* bits pushed off the top come back in at the bottom */
```

`uint32_t` is in `stdint.h`, `bool` in `stdbool.h`.

